     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>»pilot 4.0« is the extensive and comprehensive software solution for all ZOLLER presetting and measuring machines. The intuitive graphical user interface guides users quickly and reliably to precise measurement results. This makes »pilot 4.0« so easy to use that even complex measuring tasks can be completed immediately. At the same time, the software is so comprehensive in its functionality that there is a solution for every requirement. It is not for nothing that »pilot 4.0« is considered the world's unrivaled benchmark for tool setting, measurement and testing.</p>",
